{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8424cff1e3250f3e6c27a9381782599dd14f3d6444c9d600b6f7619cd584c4de","ja":"どしたの、このみん?\nこれから写真撮影なのに、元気ないよ？","zh":"怎么了，木美？\n接下来还要拍照呢，怎么无精打采的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"af50af67eb416c6c756e6f344095735925e4e18e4e9aa781c724696a4d6aff7f","ja":"あ、そうよね。\nごめんなさい、つい……。","zh":"啊，也是呢。\n抱歉，我不自觉就……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e91470537b7bfff1cc7d02ddd870a691e694b8918d036b00c542f0772a7ee664","ja":"もしかして、例の挑戦が、\nあんまり上手くいってないのかにゃ？","zh":"难道说，那个挑战\n不太顺利喵？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"655063b4826b52079fabf9c02571ff6f272c5c34ff4e03a7fa62d3332fbfb056","ja":"星梨花ちゃんから聞いたのね？　実はそうなの。\n期限が近いんだけど、途中でつまづいちゃって……。","zh":"是从小星梨花那里听说的吧？其实是这样的。\n期限快到了，可中途却卡住了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d8536aff7e6697de0954829774665bed5be3a2867096e9df28705c6fb581d676","ja":"それじゃあ、茜ちゃんが手伝おっか？\nおすそ分けがなくなっちゃうのは残念だし。","zh":"那就让小茜来帮忙吧？\n要是分不到的话未免也太可惜了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3bcf32d66aa900c7a1b0a06999ccf6898e0cc29224bf9aa27fe8bf669c6463bc","ja":"あ、もちろん、このみんを応援したい、\nっていうのが一番だからね。","zh":"啊，当然，最主要的\n还是想为木实加油啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"28d466e2a5a8447c170b9ebcc77fc2c12e92d9539b6571cf51705f4b031e50d1","ja":"ありがと。でも、自分の力でやり遂げたいから。","zh":"谢谢。不过，我想凭自己的力量坚持到底。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8299eb5ce6c96bc966950c53b21fd04733c3483dd061f9cea02aff68c7f2c3cb","ja":"そっか～。あ、でも茜ちゃんの力が\n欲しくなったら、いつでも声をかけてね♪","zh":"这样啊～。啊，不过要是需要小茜的力量，\n随时都可以叫我哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"9ad48308dfc8a23c0547672b994c0499862d49dc5218489c946e47a57bd73a23","ja":"フフ、心強いわ。\n……っと。私、呼ばれたみたい。行ってくるわね。","zh":"呵呵，真令人安心。\n……啊。好像有人叫我了。那我过去一趟哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a35d8ee7c8b28a5e4b412ce84c253411be4b5f9e134d78ba6b6c5fbd0b66c95d","ja":"はいはーい。\nいってらっしゃーい。","zh":"好——的。\n慢走哦——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0250631a5f0e7c4ee0def50813f946aea02c91df2df670874ed62bcf318d1e4b","ja":"わたしたちの撮影、終わりました！","zh":"我们的拍摄结束了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1035bee8cfb1344f14c13443a37ea901396e490ccb5191c8cd788e5ee3913325","ja":"お疲れ様～♪","zh":"辛苦啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c64b8f56ef2bd9a732c0344a96aac52b9f0dda61b26b9c9f0d1bd3b524ba3a69","ja":"ところで、結局、このみんの挑戦って、\nなんなんだろうね？","zh":"话说回来，木美到底要挑战\n什么呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e46670982bbafedc8fc74c14b6d90e170592b07c8fa01af08525ef84cb30ab2d","ja":"そうですね……本を買いに行っていたから、\nなにかのお勉強でしょうか？","zh":"是啊……因为之前去买书了，\n是在学习什么东西吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"dbb10c6ba6a9efffc66ac08222723a80b473a4611363cb73161fd56b4b88f5b6","ja":"資格を取ろうとしているのかも\nしれませんね～？","zh":"说不定是想去考取\n某种资格呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"091317eb5ce81e4325481e72f80ce19b458ad6887e1a8bf2f9ed21dc6941f1f4","ja":"珍しい資格なら、話題性も出て、\nアイドルのお仕事に役立ちそうですし～。","zh":"要是罕见的资格证书，还能引发话题，\n感觉也能对偶像工作派上用场呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1425.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"59c63ff354986a09d4b3cc3210325e00c862ffc1790c795513173d8bbd2f58a9","ja":"ん～……でもそれだと、\nどんなおすそ分けがあるのかニャ～……？","zh":"唔～……不过那样的话，\n会有什么样的分红喵～……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
